{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "a904da9c538cd36f43e6961781838fecbbe1edee20869ca2fa28433717572d86", "ja": "修羅場！！！", "zh": "修罗场！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ec589d85f9cc37eff93aea0db138e38e0a765a000eedd8b8b21af2e65cb73879", "ja": "〆切の迫る原稿作業中。思うように描けず\n苦しんでいたシンカは、絵コンテを変えたら\nどうかと提案してきたりこに八つ当たりをし\nてしまう。部室を飛び出して行ったりこの前\nに現れたのは、先輩部員Lichtだった。", "zh": "临近截稿日期的赶稿工作中。因无法画出理想的内容\n而痛苦挣扎的心花，对提出要不要修改分镜\n这一建议的理子迁怒发了火。冲出活动室的\n理子面前，出现的是社团的前辈成员Licht。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1000_narration", "source_sha256": "1696cfb8651cb83aa20742dfe692be64d587be282b06660d297ff203fe9ea674", "ja": "とある日の修羅場……\nいわゆる〆切の迫る原稿作業中……", "zh": "某天的修罗场……\n也就是正在赶截稿期限将近的稿子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "ff5e0f78bdefc85bf6f6cb16a9468b5f4debcefdf361ce5ed7db765cf192d1a4", "ja": "うぐっ……なんだこのコマ……！？\n誰だこんなネーム切ったの。……アタシか。", "zh": "呜……这是什么鬼分镜……！？\n谁画的这种分镜啊。……是我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "1b1577de9dfa702f67b581688f8d29ed63ea12a6b6c272e8117026b9b71c08b5", "ja": "め、めんどくさそうなコマですね……。\n背景、かなり描き込まないとですし……。", "zh": "这、这格看起来好麻烦啊……\n背景也得画得相当细致才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "72ff06210c9b9a7a1669a964a291615af64106083d3f79a1f628918f21e94af7", "ja": "そうだ、アングルを変えてごまかすのはどうですか？\nそれならほら、描き込みの手間も減りますし……。", "zh": "对了，要不要换个角度蒙混过去？\n这样一来，你看，精细描绘的工夫也能省下不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "c3ede7aba25223ac8c799eec23ade87668e8d3fe44687ee549b83c30382e4401", "ja": "……。\nいや、絵コンテは変えたくない。", "zh": "……\n不，我不想改分镜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "d357d27e26fa49a642d5d2868cd5898e944e34c616b61fda10e2b8c5936330a3", "ja": "で、でも……。これを描ききるには、\nかなりの時間と、根気がいるかと……。", "zh": "可、可是……要把这个画完，恐怕需要相当长的时间和耐心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "187ccceb95587e65c29f50dec3dc4d013d7458eab1b112d25e0f7e87e9a03b23", "ja": "アタシ、下手だからさ。\nしっかり見せ場は作んないと……。", "zh": "我画得不太好嘛。\n所以得好好安排出彩的地方才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "ddb2bd507106157fc0bc5721be82bbfdccc55f3e9069697813d746b98dbdc3bc", "ja": "ええっ！？　……シンカちゃん、上手いと\n思いますよ？　少なくとも私より……。", "zh": "诶！？……Shinka，我觉得你很厉害啊？至少比我厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "9d4061003b5405980e302cf3575890302f74446e41795b332d50bbf4436a25ab", "ja": "……りこ、今回の新刊何部作るの？", "zh": "……莉子，你这次的新刊打算印多少本啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "1673b07c46aa302e920f913a5dc5c912070a44e0d1f9c48e035de8abd5431b6e", "ja": "え？　えっと……。", "zh": "诶？呃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "e7dc76da959bcb85b11c468bdb66bf8d50045a754661f9930e5f970502eb82b7", "ja": "アタシは50。オフセットで刷るから無理矢理この数に\nしたけど、ホントは30だっていいくらいだよ……。", "zh": "我这边是50。因为要用胶印来印，只好硬凑成这个数，但其实就算是30也没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "3042556402f46a57961c6b08353e2352df65240a558d5d2cbc4352df5e0a16d2", "ja": "ぶ、部数と絵の上手さは関係ないですよ！　それに\nシンカちゃんは、まだ描き始めたばっかりで……。", "zh": "册、册数和画得好不好没有关系！而且，シンカ才刚开始画画……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "e888ce12439e0efaf48de5a9d5b1b80d3a2f0e7aea2f18be191a2eebcee29cd4", "ja": "絵の上手いりこに、アタシの悩みはわからないよ！\n……あっ。", "zh": "画画很厉害的莉子才不会明白我的烦恼呢！……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "4844da199544e2f5259614c44519bb1a926ef2ee54b4f8621c62f966d0781eb3", "ja": "……そう、ですね。\n私には、わからないと思います……。", "zh": "……是呢。\n我想，我确实无法理解……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "84cf95d2acf21104f9036bdb5164a0848db8c8367eea5e2e76eeeaf04c2439ae", "ja": "私は、絵が上手いわけじゃなくて……\n線画と色塗りが、ちょっぴり得意なだけで……。", "zh": "我并不是很擅长画画……\n只是稍微擅长线稿和上色而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "3fda614139b70fb0dc4cdc40a72c302bd0a01ec6ed1ac17591e02247ce93f9ca", "ja": "お話も……シンカちゃんやLichtちゃんみたいに、\n心臓を突き刺すようなものは、描けませんから……。", "zh": "故事也……我画不出像シンカ和Licht那样，能直刺人心的作品……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "d3617e031cc915dd46f32777ff730f3180265a766b3475c43ab8fba227159f71", "ja": "！\nちがっ……！", "zh": "！不、不是那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "00e2c0056d12ead8567be36acf4b7704b3e8521108641bb2d6dadc321984f780", "ja": "違いません！！！", "zh": "没错！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1018_se", "source_sha256": "848c3e215ae272ad9ccaef89e987b2e3f91845ac6b3773b4d23844295d2abf50", "ja": "バタン！　バタバタバタ……", "zh": "砰！　扑通扑通扑通……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "6fb0f55bb42258fa63af8b650dcdadb56d5e24bf56a0548f728748d6b8eb3b8d", "ja": "今、出て行ったのは……りこさん？", "zh": "刚才出去的是……莉子小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "5aab85a9c1b803b5e701b9c569f2e907530ec17ea82dae2955115e2aa2db257f", "ja": "シンカちゃん、どうかしたの？", "zh": "真香，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "35563effcc339e573de824801dd656b54254b950a27d3c95939a2e1d67f99f9c", "ja": "アタシ……自分が思うように描けないからって、\nりこに八つ当たりしちゃって……。", "zh": "我……因为没法画出自己想要的样子，就把气撒在莉子身上了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "b3b74a3d9e5b6b919fd127088b87edee01a8ba8dd403e4abb2212f3c3007f0fd", "ja": "こんなの、最低だ……。", "zh": "这种行为，真是太差劲了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "cfe900eacb8a19b23223afa7ba103a951d15d15916279904f31bb1954ed9f9e5", "ja": "つ、つい飛び出してきちゃったけど……ファミレスも\nカフェもひとりじゃ入れないんでした！　ぼっち辛い！", "zh": "虽、虽然一不小心就跑出来了……可家庭餐厅和咖啡馆，我都没法一个人进去！孤零零的好难受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "ba91e47d5f02d9ee05701c09109c3bc1a6c82424e05bddadd5a3b404e43b5fb4", "ja": "それじゃあ、私が一緒に入ってあげようか？", "zh": "那要不要我陪你一起进去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_03_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "9a57fc8b815d00229880832e63bf1886ba3ec4b101b6a6b151df72d23b4e8274", "ja": "ヒェッ！？\n……り、Lichtちゃん！", "zh": "咦！？\n……莉、Licht！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
